{"id":"nikuda","lemma":"никуда","pos":"adv","rank":531,"glosses":["to nowhere, nowhither"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/12/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я, наверное, никуда сегодня не пойду.","en":"I'll probably not go anywhere today.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"probably, most likely"},null,{"g":"today"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"}]},{"text":"Тебе лучше никуда не выходить.","en":"You'd better not go out.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"rather, would better )"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to go out"}]},{"text":"Мы никуда не можем сегодня пойти.","en":"We can't go anywhere today.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"today"},{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Я больше никуда не хочу идти.","en":"There's nowhere else I want to go.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"any more"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Мы с тобой никуда не пойдём.","en":"We're not going anywhere with you.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"}]}]}